{"unit_id":"AngelosZou__dsh-python-env#card-zh","repo":"AngelosZou/dsh-python-env","commit":"d24039c579b644101577383ef5734fff78d43439","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-python-env 为 DeepSeek Harness 工作区提供 Python 虚拟环境管理，注册环境发现、创建、安装、卸载和删除五个工具，并附带使用技能与提示指导。它通过 DSH subprocess 服务运行 Python 和 pip，支持主流桌面系统；安装可读取包规格或 requirements 文件，并提供 pip 修复、镜像重试及后台任务。适合需要为项目配置 Python 依赖的 DSH 用户；需要相应 DSH 服务和 Python 3.8 以上版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:54-65","lib/tools/install.js:86-119","lib/python.js:76-105"]}
{"unit_id":"AngelosZou__dsh-python-env#card-en","repo":"AngelosZou/dsh-python-env","commit":"d24039c579b644101577383ef5734fff78d43439","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-python-env manages Python environments in DSH workspaces. Five tools discover, create, install, uninstall, and remove venvs. It uses DSH subprocess, accepts package specs or requirements files, repairs pip, retries mirrors, and supports background installs. Requires Python 3.8+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:54-65","lib/tools/install.js:86-119","lib/python.js:76-105"]}
