{"unit_id":"AngelosZou__dsh-python-env#feature-discover","repo":"AngelosZou/dsh-python-env","commit":"d24039c579b644101577383ef5734fff78d43439","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「环境发现」：扫描工作区最多两层目录，按 pyvenv.cfg 标记或常见目录名查找环境，并报告路径、解释器、版本和 pip 状态。通过 pyenv_discover 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/discover.js:30-35","lib/tools/discover.js:96-116"]}
